// schema-consistent recoverable continuations. When the parser reports the SQL
// prefix is complete, we close the span immediately with ">>". The tracked
// state (insideConstrainedOut plus currentConstrainedOut as the suffix of
// generated) makes it easy to prove that the constrained segment is always a
