// parser is in a narrow state, we use `ConstrainedStep` directly. If not, we
// try the model argmax first and only append it when it is parser-valid;
// otherwise we fall back to `ConstrainedStep`.
//
// This tracked state supports validity because `currentConstrainedOut` is always
// exactly the suffix of `generated` that lies between delimiters, and every
// token appended inside the SQL span is checked against the parser before being
// committed.
